{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":204436,\"title\":\"Jack and the Cuckoo-Clock Heart\",\"tagline\":\"He must never touch the hands of the clock. He must master his anger. He must never, ever fall in love.\",\"overview\":\"Jack is born with his heart frozen solid on the coldest day in history. A wise midwife saves him by replacing it with a cuckoo clock. Now Jack must abide by three rules to keep his mechanical heart safe: never touch the clock's hands, master his anger, and never fall in love. He tries his best, but when he meets a girl named Acacia he falls in love, threatening the delicate balance of his artificial heart.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ZSrU2mvlzM5Jr30XtKCU1fziIj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rjXK74vrvmFMN0vuFw3TViZ18Ha.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":777,\"year\":2014,\"runtime\":94,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Romance\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"},{\"code\":\"BE\",\"name\":\"Belgium\"}],\"budget\":33746302,\"revenue\":3484370,\"director\":\"Stéphane Berla\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1186851,\"name\":\"Stéphane Berla\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1186852,\"name\":\"Mathias Malzieu\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/crBkNcM8zOuFfbWbWTA4xNDQ05p.jpg\"},{\"id\":1186852,\"name\":\"Mathias Malzieu\",\"character\":\"Jack (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/crBkNcM8zOuFfbWbWTA4xNDQ05p.jpg\"},{\"id\":1033011,\"name\":\"Olivia Ruiz\",\"character\":\"Miss Acacia (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/27acJQUGiErjL8HTioYm6aSjpCS.jpg\"},{\"id\":1186858,\"name\":\"Grand Corps Malade\",\"character\":\"Joe (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nRyknEQkvfnwEVnOyQNeGC9u3GY.jpg\"},{\"id\":24421,\"name\":\"Jean Rochefort\",\"character\":\"Méliès (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ar